[Viewing stats associated with a particular user]

Get-ADUser -Identity asvay -Server "aden.local" -Properties * 
>> it searches Active Directory for the user object with 
identity asvay and returns the default attributes plus all additional available properties because of -Properties *.





[Creating a new user]

New-ADUser `
    -Name "John Smith" `
    -GivenName "John" `
    -Surname "Smith" `
    -SamAccountName "jsmith" `
    -UserPrincipalName "jsmith@aden.local" `
    -Path "OU=Users,OU=USA,DC=aden,DC=local" `
    -AccountPassword (ConvertTo-SecureString 'TempLab!2026#User' -AsPlainText -Force) `
    -Enabled $true `
    -ChangePasswordAtLogon $true





